# --- local translation model cache (multi-GB, re-downloadable) ---
# --- persistent memory / audit (never committed; also excluded by MEMORY_GLOBS
# --- python bytecode caches ---
# --- scratch: editors / tooling / editors' backups ---
# --- scratch: runtime logs & one-off test artefacts ---
# --- scratch: selftest.py output ---
# --- secrets / local-only config ---
# --- volatile runtime state ---
# compiled artefacts of every module land in git history each time.
# in jarvis_os/selfupdate.py, this is defence in depth) ---
# machine-local agent/tooling config, not part of the shipped kernel
# selftest.py snapshots the whole worktree on every run, so without these the
